abstract: >-
  QSOL UFF v5.2.0 retains the v5.1.0 reproducible astrophysics, falsification,
  provenance, witness, replay-gate, ensemble-boundary, and telemetry systems
  while adding a Lean 4 specification of selected software and epistemic
  invariants. The formal layer machine-checks assurance ordering, replay
  separation, identity-bearing claim boundaries, cancellation closure,
  one-way sonification, zero-authority telemetry, no-self-hash manifest
  construction, and deterministic replay identity. It explicitly does not
  prove SHA-256 security, catalogue correctness, null-model adequacy,
  statistical independence, causality, or physical truth.
